# Google Ads conversion tracking. VITE_* values are inlined into the public
# bundle at build time, so these are not secrets — the conversion ID is visible
# in any visitor's page source. Rebuild after changing them.
#
# The two labels come from each conversion action's event snippet in Google Ads:
# Goals > Conversions > [action] > Tag setup > Install the tag yourself, then
# read the part after the slash in send_to: 'AW-409710547/<label>'.
